Package: folio-fonts
Version: 1.0.0
Section: fonts
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 4000
Replaces: folio-cork (<< 0.3.1)
Breaks: folio-cork (<< 0.3.1)
Maintainer: Ron Shillings <ron.shillings@gmail.com>
Description: the fonts that ship with Folio
 Carlito, Liberation Serif and Liberation Mono, in Latin, Greek and Cyrillic.
 Every Folio app on the portable base draws its documents from these, so a page
 looks the same on any machine whatever else is installed. Installed under
 /usr/share/folio/fonts, where the apps look for them.
